    "text": "By Bryant Kwilecki ,\n6 hours ago CHEROKEE VILLAGE, Ark. (KAIT) - Cornerstone Chapel and a nonprofit called Eve’s Table are putting together bags for foster children who often have to pack their belongings into trash bags when they are removed from their homes. The group filled 40 storage bags with blankets and other items to... Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak",
